Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon, the rain\Nwill be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the\Nanchor, now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up,\Nwe set self cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme wanna see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.\NIt's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this happen? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to Zoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make whoever's behind this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:03:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it was those depraved,\Nstraw-hot virus behind all this destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did they do to my home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This fortress was a living space\Nonce inhabited by our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Zunesha has carried the entire\Nhistory of the Mink tribe on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One of our most cherished traditions\Nhas been passed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The trading of clothes with an\Noutsider is a symbol of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Must belong to someone important, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We insist that you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Garchu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mademoiselle, Crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Crush?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you? Crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush! Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, you sure like our greeting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a miraculous magic word!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I don't know what it means!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to do a round of Crush\Nwith our savior! Piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ladies only!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Viva l'Amintimusia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's locked himself away in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He was suffering from anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's better if he's incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're at it, we should avoid\Nthe word samurai while we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.66,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it were up to me, I'd\Nhand the brat over to the minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And ditch this dumb\Nisland already. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the update on the medicine, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I met the\Nquota since I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop slacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a great deal\Nof people in need of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we have more than enough, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, I've come to pick up the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have me mixed\Nup with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Cedar the pharmacist. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, why do I have to make\Nthis crap to help people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tia. Dr. Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm supposed to be Caesar the genius\Nmad scientist, not the charity worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, almost forgot. Call me Cedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Heya, Baron Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Some fans are waiting outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they only want me for my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not entertain that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Peckholms, good to see you, Conney.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you're all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom, my friends and\Nfamily, you're all alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Peckholms, this\Nbrings back good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so wonderful to have\Nyou, Conney, back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so happy when\Nyou're covered in cuts and bruises?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart nearly stopped when I saw the\Nstate that the city was in! Ease up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, Pickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to the Straw Hat\NPirates that were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for their\Ncompassion and quick action,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to think of what\Nwould have happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for hanging in there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I will never forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Junk of the Beast Pirates\Nfor as long as I live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he terrorize my innocent old lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's them, they're\Nfrom the Big Mom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have tailed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Peckham's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid was a troublemaker growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's a mint?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that makes sense, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have overheard\Nwhere we were heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, please don't\Nhand me over, pretty please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that you are our trump\Ncard for dealing with Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Luffy and the others have beaten\Nhim, we don't have a use for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now how could you say that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're bros, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When did we become bros?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what the hell did you do to\Npiss off Big Mom? Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just hear me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I accepted a grant for\Nresearch from Big Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't quite gotten\Nanywhere with it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so I lied and pocketed all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doe Flamingo had my back at the time,\Nso I may have gotten a bit carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you earned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're just looking for\NCaesar, that's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass, and then\NI'll make Fishman Island my territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Although that may not be the case,\NLuffy did pick a fight with Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We busted up their ship pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Blackleg, how about we work\Ntogether and take out the goons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, stay here with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Brooke, you come with me. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still considering my\Nbrilliant assassination proposition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking for\Nsuggestions from dumbasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright you guys, what\Nexactly do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this land have had their\Nfair share of suffering recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not add to\Ntheir list of traumas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we try to talk things over first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected to come back home and\Nsee it completely devastated like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you and your crew may\Nselflessly save my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the reason they're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama gave two orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,First was to capture Caesar, but this\Nsecond one won't be too pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It might even mean the end of\Nthe road for the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm calling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission isn't failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hand over Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain to mama that we let the\NStryhats get away this time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta choke those feelings down,\Nkid, if you knows what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up, new guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take the fall for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand the position I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything to the people who\Nsaved the lives of my friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow-bellied rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd he shoot him? They're allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that real? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He don't look it, but he's\Ngot quite the rap sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, he decided to act on his\Nstupid feelings, and now he's gone soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he ain't no good to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look alive, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His gut?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How messed up is that? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw those men in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought I imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's on account of the\Ncastle. castle fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we're both considered to be part\Nof the same generation of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy knows me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy clocked that\Ncelestial dragon back at Sabaody,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you were there with the rest\Nof the worst generation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But we ain't trying to make a scene here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep this thing quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of the minks show up, then it's a\Npretty good bet they'll take your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe you me, those\Ncats really know how to scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vino!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut that out! Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were getting really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And we thought there\Nwere only two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we can fill you full\Nof holes with these
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,sea prism stone bullets\Nin about three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Light him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, here I come! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't point those at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it occurs to me we\Nain't got no sea prism stone ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What we do have is a spear\Nthat'll work the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we ought to continue this\Nconversation inside my castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's calling all the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So we were forced to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anybody hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get to the point already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die in this gangster's gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure wouldn't kill\Nyou to relax a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,About a week ago, you and I took\Na couple of shots at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the situation's evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been asked to make sure\Nthat this invitation reaches you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your presence is requested\Nat Mama's Tea Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look like the kind of guy\Nwho'd want to sip tea with Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just a tea party.\NThere's a wedding. Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The groom-to-be is the\Nthird son of the Vinsmokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And the lucky dame is the 35th daughter\Nof the Charlotte family, Puddin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's a wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sanji's the groom-to-be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can keep this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell should I know what\Nkind of deal you folks made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to burn my castle down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,who's bright idea was this and why you're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the vinsmoke here how\Nam i supposed to know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that although in your\Ncase i'd say the apple
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,must have fallen pretty far from the tree
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sanji's a vinsmoke that\Nchills me to the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,which is quite the\Npredicament to find yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,in in my case there\Nmust be some mistake hey
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,top off my wine sir what\Ndo we know about sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, have you heard of it, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It says right here the book was\Noriginally published in the North Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born in the North Blue Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain I must have told you\Nguys that Oh, that's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I always thought you\Nwere born in the East.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, what's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember feeling strange\Nwhen he told us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We met him in the East Blue, but\Nhe was born in the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me now? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if that's true,\Nthen this is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to travel from\Nthe North Blue to the East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'd have to cross\Nthe Red Line. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that super hard to do? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just any ordinary old sea voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sanji, he was just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize, Charlotte happens\Nto be the surname of Big Mom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's marrying the child of the most\Nruthless woman in the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's joining\Nan emperor's family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far worse than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If she has a member of your\Ncrew as her son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then the whole lot of you\Nwill become her underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump to conclusions. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea party, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They want me to marry a\Ngirl I don't even know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:20:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have to find out by getting\Nan invite to my own wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy if you think I'm gonna let\Nthe Straw Hats become your playthings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll never work—our captain\Ndoesn't take orders from anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, because he's gonna\Nbe king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we done here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want Caesar, he's all yours I think\Nyou might have the wrong idea, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The invitation was just\Na matter of formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking whether you would accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you, you're inside\Nmy body, you're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm handing you over to mama\Nlike lambs to the slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and there ain't nothing you\Nsaps can do about it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably haven't noticed\Nit, but I'm already on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel it's moving at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman will kill me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to rumble, we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganji, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I control everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I could clobber you with\Nanything in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's swollen high! Nami, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, dirtbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Nami? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I didn't smack your pals around,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't excuse yourself\Nfrom Mama's deep art, anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a little something\Neverybody in the new world knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bittersweets and empty seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are two things\NMama won't allow, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever someone tells her no, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say it\Nain't a pretty picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a lot of tears involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So choose carefully, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyololololo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A tea party invite from Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something you just don't turn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.60,0:23:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.14,0:23:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, it's the law, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody has to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the devil himself won't refuse Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can always no-show,\NLili, but, uh, you would regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Better listen closely, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.08,0:24:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,New Where the hell did you get that info?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.00,0:24:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who we answer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.22,0:24:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The four emperors are the toughest\Ncontenders around, so they run the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, one of\Nthem is Big Mom herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.26,0:24:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But she always gets her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If she decides a guy's dead, then\Npow, he's sleeping with the fishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.28,0:24:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So every word out of that mug\Nof yours could be life or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you intend to survive, and you\Ndon't want to end up Mama's lapdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd play along for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.68,0:25:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.59,0:25:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.51,0:25:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What did that man say to you just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyolu?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.09,0:25:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell us we can help you, no\Nmatter how bad she is, we can beat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.74,0:25:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet already!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me borrow a pen and some paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.38,0:25:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, is that a cute note to Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.66,0:25:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.86,0:25:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.38,0:25:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, wait—you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.34,0:25:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, Chopper,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook—I want you all to know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to hide anything\Nfrom my friends. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,part of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.07,0:26:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd ever\Nhave to deal with again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.06,0:26:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,caught up to me, and I have to\Nsettle this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing this all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.02,0:26:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a powerful presence outside—probably\Nsomeone from the Mink Tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the mink tribe Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.26,0:26:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.90,0:26:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Threw me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.88,0:26:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped his bunnies get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.12,0:26:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.46,0:27:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this scumbag's important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.18,0:27:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't make me blow\Nhis genius brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to pay for this someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.92,0:27:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't allowed\Nto kill me. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With all this talk about the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.96,0:27:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I put two and two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.48,0:27:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On my poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In big bold letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.46,0:27:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It says only alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill me, then somebody is\Ngoing to be really pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.80,0:27:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me guess, they said to treat me\Nrespectfully with no handcuffs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who got those words on my\Nposter and the one who set this wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.52,0:27:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're the same person!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.02,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quirk, we gotta go capture the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I tell you to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.04,0:27:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, you know exactly\Nwho's got my back, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.70,0:28:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I need to sort things\Nout with that person,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,which means I am coming along with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.08,0:28:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't you dare lay\Na finger on my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is moving a\Nmuscle. Hurt, but father
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.26,0:28:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,be cool, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.82,0:28:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster right\Noutside the castle—master
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,cat viper, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.98,0:28:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't realize you were awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.74,0:28:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is he a giant cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.94,0:28:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta—what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,explain to me why I just found Peck\Narms in a pool of his own blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.82,0:28:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it all wrong, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.40,0:28:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my Gourmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gourmet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.47,0:28:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you heard me from the\Nsame pirate group—we got
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.78,0:29:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,roughed up by a few of the\Nstragglers from Jack's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.68,0:29:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to this jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Face what would I want\Nto shoot my own guy for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.84,0:29:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come out, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.90,0:29:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why we can't join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.92,0:29:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just wait for everyone\Nelse—we're much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.74,0:29:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,else we're much stronger\Ntogether, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my problem to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.02,0:29:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.24,0:29:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So give everybody my best, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.66,0:29:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle Tank, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.82,0:29:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to catch him. I\Nfear it's no use, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's made up his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.56,0:30:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
